mapping "V6130.1" source="V6130" target="219965005" relationship=equivalent {
    confidence 0.03 scheme="vocabmod-se-confidence@1"
    comment "en" """
        Source V6130 SNOMED CT 219965005 = unspecified occupant of heavy transport vehicle injured in
        collision with pedal cycle in a nontraffic accident, during sport. Target = [X]Occupant of heavy
        transport vehicle injured in collision with pedal cycle, unspecified occupant injured in
        nontraffic accident. The SNOMED CT [X] code is the WHO-SNOMED CT formal equivalent of ICD-10 V61.3;
        the Swedish activity suffix (idrott/sport) has no SNOMED CT representation and is dropped.
        Injury-event semantics (occupant type + traffic context) are exactly captured. : exact term
        match on the [X] crosswalk concept, no independent Athena verification for Swedish-extension
        codes, activity dimension lost.
        """
}
